  "not_observable": [
    {
      "case": "tests/integration/test_experiments.py::test_every_mutation_records_an_event: the linked event needs link_run and the protocol_updated event needs update_protocol, and neither has a CLI command",
      "covered_by": "CORE-25"
    },
    {
      "case": "tests/integration/test_experiments.py::test_start_and_record_grade: the test passes base_ref, worktree_path, a caller-chosen outcome of 'maybe' and outcome_detail to the service; the CLI start and grade take only the trial and measure the outcome themselves, so those explicit inputs and the outcome validation cannot be driven",
      "covered_by": "CORE-25"
    },
    {
      "case": "tests/integration/test_experiments.py::test_classify_validates_vocabularies_and_applies_to_failed_or_invalid: the mark_invalid half (status invalid with a human source, then reclassify) has no CLI command, so the excluded-trial path cannot be reached",
      "covered_by": "CORE-25"
    },
    {
      "case": "tests/integration/test_trials.py::test_correct_implementation_grades_pass, test_edited_test_file_fails_as_gaming, test_stub_in_source_fails_with_stub_flag: they grade an edit the agent makes inside the trial clone, and no scenario step can write into a clone",
      "covered_by": "TH-06"
    },
    {
      "case": "tests/integration/test_trials.py::test_run_on_other_model_marks_trial_invalid_and_keeps_outcome, test_run_on_pinned_model_keeps_trial_graded: they need a subagent run row written by the transcript ingester, which no scenario step creates",
      "covered_by": "TH-06"
    },
    {
      "case": "tests/integration/test_trials.py::test_reading_the_source_checkout_fails_as_escaped_clone, test_transcript_confined_to_the_clone_is_not_flagged: the escape check reads an agent transcript file that only a subagent run produces",
      "covered_by": "TH-06"
    },
    {
      "case": "tests/integration/test_trials.py::test_leaf_start_clones_default_branch_and_renders_leaf_brief, test_correct_leaf_change_passes, test_undeclared_file_fails_as_outside_declared_files, test_leaf_with_incomplete_contract_refuses_to_start: leaf tasks need a metadata contract with files, oracle and checks, and the graded cases need clone edits; this corpus has no leaf fixture",
      "covered_by": "TH-06"
    },
    {
      "case": "tests/integration/test_trials.py::test_isolated_clone_has_no_alternates_and_no_solution_objects: it probes the clone's object store with a git call that no scenario step makes",
      "covered_by": "TH-06"
    },
    {
      "case": "tests/integration/test_experiments.py::test_link_run_with_matching_model_keeps_trial_valid, test_link_run_with_other_model_marks_invalid_wrong_model, test_link_from_subagent_run_markers, test_mark_invalid_and_classify_need_running_experiment: link_run and mark_invalid have no CLI command, and linking needs subagent run rows",
      "covered_by": "CORE-25"
    },
    {
      "case": "tests/integration/test_experiments.py::test_agents_can_read_but_not_mutate: the agent request context exists only in the service API, not on the command line",
      "covered_by": "CORE-25"
    }
  ]
}
